  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn: You can target 1 Fusion Monster
    you control; it gains 1000 ATK for each monster your opponent controls, until
    the end of this turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \n1 \"Starving Venom\" monster +
    1 \"Odd-Eyes\" monster\r\nMust be Fusion Summoned, and can then be Pendulum Summoned.
    Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; until
    the End Phase, this card gains ATK equal to its ATK, and if it does, this card's
    name becomes that monster's original name, and replace this effect with that
    monster's original effects. If this card in the Monster Zone is destroyed: You
    can Special Summon 1 monster from your Pendulum Zone, and if you do, place this
    card in your Pendulum Zone."
